gine/godot/pull/121453","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121453.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121453.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-20T23:37:52Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120470\r\n\r\nWith the combination in the PR title, the 2D MSAA resolve buffer can be used as the target for the bilinear upscale operation. However, since this texture has the \"is_resolve_buffer\" set to `true`, it'd always get assigned as a resolve attachment in `framebuffer_create`'s [automatic pass](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/49f68a134ec7997dda2eb5b92a1f43eb37273498/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp#L3637). To solve this, we explicitly create the pass and attach the texture as a color attachment.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nMultiview was also failing with this, so I tried to fix it, but I'm not sure if the solution here is correct for it, since `dest_is_msaa_2d` [cannot ever be true for multiview](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/49f68a134ec7997dda2eb5b92a1f43eb37273498/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/renderer_scene_render_rd.cpp#L494), it seems...?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121453/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}